WEBVTT

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:14.560
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.800
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.200
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.240
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.180
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.070
They're gone... Both of them.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.500
l wonder if they're okay...

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.230
Captain...Bravo...

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.540
lt's time to settle our score...
Kazuki Muto...

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.320
What are you talking about, Bravo?

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:21.050
Look at me, l'm human right now.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.450
There are stages to the Victor transformation.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.390
You are still at stage one, and the process has not solidified yet.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:31.930
lf my calculations are correct, you have about six weeks...

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:36.500
By the time summer vacation is over, you too will turn into a monster like Victor,

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.300
who spreads death and destruction simply by existing.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:42.270
Before that happens, you must be disposed of.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.880
That is my new mission.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.410
Bravo?

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.020
You were killed by a Homunculus.

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:55.310
The life that warrior Tokiko gave you should not have been allowed.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.590
You must be killed once again to set things right.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:01:59.920
Bravo...

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.230
Kazuki Muto must be re-exterminated!

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:13.770
Say it isn't so, Bravo...

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.540
Tell me it isn't so, Bravo!

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:22.470
lt's a lie!

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:28.220
Lies, lies, lies, lies! lt's...a...lie...

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.050
Neither good nor evil.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:35.620
There is no falsehood about a conviction carried through to the end.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.090
The very words you said when you recruited me as a warrior.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:43.430
My conviction is to save as many people as l can.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.370
And to do that, l am willing to kill a fellow warrior.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.140
l would even become evil itself.

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:53.710
<i>lt's no lie. What l see before me</i> <i>is the real thing...</i>

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.640
<i>Captain Bravo...</i>

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.160
Won't you lay down your life...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.420
Kazuki?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.190
l understand...

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.900
But not now. l won't give up yet!

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:16.470
Those same words are what encouraged me

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.240
to become an Alchemist Warrior with the same convictions as you!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:23.070
lf l only have six weeks left as a human being,

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.310
then l shall carry through my convictions to the end!

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.480
Buso Renkin!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.660
We'll end this here.

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.660
Yes! I'll triumph and end this!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:08.420
<i>With Strength and Spirit</i>

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.590
<i>Where are you, Kazuki? Where...</i>

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:52.960
Tokiko!

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.030
l've got to search for Kazuki...

00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:00.670
He can't have gone that far.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.010
Here!

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:12.220
Thank you...

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:01.890
Comet Bravo Kick!

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.370
What was that?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:09.980
lt came from over there!

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:42.570
<i>Kazuki!</i>

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.530
Are you all right?

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.510
What about you? ls your shoulder wound okay?

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.840
This is nothing.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:50.440
We should be getting close.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:51.710
Yes, it looks so!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:56.120
Kazuki!

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.080
What's going on?

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:01.120
Wasn't his opponent supposed to be Warrior Chief Hiwatari?

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:05.390
After them!

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.120
<i>Captain Bravo.</i>

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:35.050
Site of the Future Green Hill

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:00.080
To think his opponent would be Captain Bravo...

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.910
But he might have a better chance of winning against Captain Bravo

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.180
than against Warrior Chief Hiwatari.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.360
lf we make it in time that is!

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.990
Could it be possible? ls there any way to win over Captain Bravo?

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.250
There is!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.790
<i>l must tear the Silver Skin.</i>

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.270
<i>l-l...!</i>

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:24.700
A well thought-out offense.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:29.060
And yet...it was all in vain.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.580
A well thought-out offense.

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:50.150
And yet...it was all in vain.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:17.170
You become more powerful each time you fight.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.980
That is why...

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.490
l must end you here and now!

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:25.550
<i>Here it comes. Silver Skin Reverse!</i>

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:46.470
Gota!

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:49.510
Just as you suspected, Tokiko,

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:53.610
even the Silver Skin is not capable of remote-controlled precision movement.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:58.930
lf that were possible, there would be no need to wear it.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.860
You'd just simply manipulate the Silver Skin as an automaton type.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:06.960
The most you can do is atomize and launch it, isn't that correct?

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:12.970
Then, if you force your way into it, the way l just did,

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.600
the Silver Skin won't reach its target...

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:17.980
The same thing would happen

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:19.510
even if you launched the one you're now wearing.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:23.110
My motor gear is faster than "Silver Skin Reverse."

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:28.260
Silver Skin Reverse will no longer be effective in this battle.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:34.990
Warrior Tokiko, Gota, have you no regrets about the actions you have chosen?!

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:36.260
None!

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:40.660
l see. Then, both of you, stand back.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.930
l will try and see to it

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.970
that you can return to the Alchemist Army when this battle is finished.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.000
l don't want to return if it's without Kazuki.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:54.450
Please listen.
We are not being haphazard.

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:57.410
Newton's Apple Girls Academy...

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:00.220
lf you know about that, then give us a little more time...

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:01.480
give Kazuki a little more time!

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.180
Even if your actions were not haphazard,

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.690
they amounted to but a faint glimmer in the dark.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:10.460
You should not stake many people's lives on such a slim chance!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:11.900
Warrior Chief.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.430
For one hundred years,

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.800
the Alchemist Army has continued to pursue Victor.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:20.900
My presence here represents the conclusion of those 100 years!

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:22.700
There is nothing to be done

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.970
with those who have exchanged life for the black kakugane

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:26.070
but bury them!

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:33.110
The Silver Skin can be torn by an impact greater than its strength.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.390
But it's regenerative power,

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.390
which far exceeds the speed of destruction, prevents a follow-up attack.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.260
lf that is the case,

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.700
if we follow up on an attack with a speed that exceeds the regenerative force...

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:51.130
Use this, Kazuki.
And transform into Victor!

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:54.430
Double Buso Renkin plus Victor Power!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:57.680
This is the only way to tear through the Silver Skin!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:13:59.280
No...

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:04.640
lf l do, the Energy Drain will engage.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:08.590
lt won't be like the time at Ginsei High where there were lots of people around.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:09.990
Kazuki!

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:11.390
Without a doubt,

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:15.820
it will inflict damage that would threaten your life Tokiko, and Gota's, too.

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:17.490
What are you saying?

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:18.860
Are you going to throw away your chance to win?

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.600
Don't worry about me. l've resigned myself to whatever happens.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:25.000
l don't care either. lt's what Tokiko wants!

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:29.340
l'm sorry, but l don't want to!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:36.110
l want to protect everyone.
That's why l became an Alchemist Warrior..

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:38.980
So, whatever happens,

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:41.720
l don't want to fight a battle that will harm my comrades!

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:45.220
That's my conviction!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:51.290
Warrior Chief...
Do you still intend to kill Kazuki?

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.490
Having crushed that single strand of light,

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:55.130
do you mean to tell me that you would still kill him?

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.300
Please answer me, Warrior Chief!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:01.210
Answer me, Captain Bravo!

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.170
lt's okay, Tokiko.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.740
Neither l nor Captain Bravo regrets the actions we have taken!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:11.550
<i>Kazuki!</i>

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.930
Silver Skin Another Type Reverse!

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.870
Silver Skin Reverse!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.440
Double strait!

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.550
This is my answer, Warrior Tokiko.

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:22.580
l will terminate Kazuki and defeat Victor.

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:26.980
l will fulfill my duty as
Warrior Chief Captain Bravo.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:28.730
Warrior Chief!

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:37.530
After my mission is completed l shall end my life as Mamoru Sakimori,

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.700
the sinner responsible for killing his subordinate.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:44.980
Kazuki...l shall not force death upon you alone!

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:50.070
That's not funny!
This is no time for jokes, Captain Bravo.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:12.600
Captain Bravo, l'm going to defeat you!

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:18.300
l will win... l will win and l'm not going to let you die!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.070
Energy Full Power!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.310
Very well!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.290
Kazuki!

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:20.400
Reach...!

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:22.400
What?

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.140
Re-e-each!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:54.270
He simply struck with all the strength and feelings he had...

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.870
and pierced through!

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:01.850
A strong will to desperately defend those precious to you!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:05.040
You threw yourself in the way, regardless of your own life, to save Tokiko...

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.780
You defeated Papillon, despite the pain it has caused you,

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.410
to prevent any more victims.

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:14.460
You pushed your battered body to its limit to save Ouka and Shusui,

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:16.330
and fought with body and soul to protect

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:20.270
your friends, your sister, and the students of the school...

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:26.000
You exhibit your true full power at times when you are protecting someone.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:30.370
A strong will to desperately defend those precious to you!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:38.150
l always knew the day would come when you would surpass me...

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:43.810
But that day has come, Warrior Kazuki.

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:46.390
Warrior Chief!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.720
Warrior Tokiko!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:49.930
Yes!

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:53.430
Lead everyone, and head directly to Newton's Apple Girls Academy.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.430
Warrior Chief!

00:19:56.070 --> 00:20:00.370
l think l shall bet upon your single strand of light, myself.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:02.410
Thank you very much.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:09.950
<i>Kazuki will become a warrior who</i> <i>will protect far more people than l have.</i>

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.880
<i>l must not put an end to</i> <i>that here and now.</i>

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.770
So he managed to survive, did he?

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.540
A stubborn fellow!

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:48.990
Captain Bravo sacrifices himself, entrusting us with his hope for the future.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:51.420
We will not let his act to protect us be in vain!

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.790
We will find the light of hope!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.530
Next time, "Gone lnto Flame"

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.800
I'll splatter your guts!

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:07.140
Mahiro Muto's Buso Renkin Seminar!

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:10.370
Hello, this is Mahiro Muto!

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:14.400
Here is another sharp introduction of the Buso Renkin from yours truly!

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:17.620
For our 7th round, we have the Motor Gear!

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.680
When we all went to the beach this summer,

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:24.210
a mysterious guy made a stylish entrance before us. Who is that guy?!

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:25.320
As it turns out,

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:29.260
he is Tokiko's junior and the newest warrior from the Alchemist Army.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.090
Wouldn't you agree with me in saying,

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:34.500
"Was it really necessary to make an entrance in such a mysterious way"?

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:37.040
Plus! Seems he is madly in LOVE with Tokiko.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:39.070
Tokiko lS his life itself!

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:42.130
Wha--?! Could this mean my big brother has a rival for affection?!

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:45.580
A man from Tokiko's past?!
Oh, my big brother is in trouble now!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:46.980
Or at least l thought he was.

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:51.110
As it turns out, my big brother and Tokiko are already in their own world of love.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:53.810
No matter who tries to come in between them, NO PROBLEM!

00:21:54.390 --> 00:21:58.090
Hey, for that matter l forgot to introduce his name!

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:01.490
His name is Gota Nakamura,

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:04.430
and in many ways he's a very unfortunate person.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:10.400
Gota Nakamura the Unfortunate's
Buso Renkin is the Motor Gear.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:13.670
lt is two circular shaped rings called the Chakram,

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:16.900
an lndian weapon that is like a boomerang!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:22.240
Gota inputs the speed, angle, and number of rotation through his bioelectricity

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:25.650
into the Motor Gear and throws it as an attack! HIYAA!

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:28.180
He can also attach them to his hands and feet too!

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:31.780
For example, attach it to the fist and PUNCH!

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:33.850
lt's called "Knuckle Duster Mode."

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:38.660
Equip it to the feet and run like an in-line skater WHOOSSH!

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:41.930
lt's called "Skywalker Mode."

00:22:42.140 --> 00:22:45.500
And! There is also another one called the "Marinediver Mode"

00:22:45.570 --> 00:22:48.440
where he uses it like a propeller underwater!

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:52.140
By the way, out of all the Buso Renkin,

00:22:52.210 --> 00:22:55.050
the Motor Gear ranks the lowest in terms of power.

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:58.880
He really is kind of unfortunate.

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:06.380
But Tokiko did say, "Gota compensates for his lack of power with his wits," right?

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:08.960
So don't ever, ever, give up!

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:11.830
Do your best Gota Nakamura.
Go, go, Gota!

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:16.070
Okie dokies, tune in next time!

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:30.220
Mahiro Illustration by Taeko Hori
